@startuml editor-shell-state
title Tab / buffer lifecycle

[*] --> Untitled : new tab (no file)
[*] --> Clean : open existing file

Untitled --> Dirty : first keystroke
Clean --> Dirty : edit
Dirty --> Clean : save() succeeds
Dirty --> Dirty : save() fails\n(I/O error shown to user)

Clean --> Closed : close tab
Dirty --> ConfirmDiscard : close tab
ConfirmDiscard --> Closed : user confirms discard
ConfirmDiscard --> Dirty : user cancels

Closed --> [*]

@enduml
